# script-ch0.rpyc:12
translate chinese ch0_main_41e273ca:

    # s "Heeeeeeeyyy!!"
    s "喂————！！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:13
translate chinese ch0_main_bcc5bb00:

    # "I see an annoying girl running toward me from the distance, waving her arms in the air like she's totally oblivious to any attention she might draw to herself."
    "只见一个烦人的女孩从远处朝我跑来，双手在空中胡乱挥舞，浑然不觉自己引来了多少目光。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:14
translate chinese ch0_main_80f1ba46:

    # "That girl is Sayori, my neighbor and good friend since we were children."
    "那个女孩就是纱世里，我的邻居，也是从小玩到大的好朋友。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:15
translate chinese ch0_main_40dc33e4:

    # "You know, the kind of friend you'd never see yourself making today, but it just kind of works out because you've known each other for so long?"
    "你懂的，就是那种放在今天你绝对想不到会去结交的朋友，但因为彼此认识得太久，也就这么自然地处下来了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:16
translate chinese ch0_main_fc8dd6bc:

    # "We used to walk to school together on days like this, but starting around high school she would oversleep more and more frequently, and I would get tired of waiting up."
    "以前碰上这样的日子，我们都会结伴走路上学，但从升上高中前后开始，她睡过头的情况越来越多，我也渐渐懒得等她了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:17
translate chinese ch0_main_0117e949:

    # "But if she's going to chase after me like this, I almost feel better off running away."
    "不过，她都要这样追上来了，我还不如干脆跑掉算了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:18
translate chinese ch0_main_a0aaf316:

    # "However, I just sigh and idle in front of the crosswalk and let Sayori catch up to me."
    "然而，我只是叹了口气，在人行横道前停住脚步，等着纱世里追上来。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:21
translate chinese ch0_main_cf958be9:

    # s 4p "Haaahhh...haaahhh..."
    s 4p "哈啊……哈啊……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:22
translate chinese ch0_main_d5b6fac2:

    # s "I overslept again!"
    s "我又睡过头啦！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:23
translate chinese ch0_main_7fa78c9d:

    # s "But I caught you this time!"
    s "但这次被我抓到你了吧！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:24
translate chinese ch0_main_164efad7:

    # mc "Maybe, but only because I decided to stop and wait for you."
    mc "也许是吧，不过那是因为我特意停下来等你。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:26
translate chinese ch0_main_426a9522:

    # s 5c "Eeehhhhh, you say that like you were thinking about ignoring me!"
    s 5c "诶————！你这话说得好像刚才打算无视我似的！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:27
translate chinese ch0_main_15216994:

    # s "That's mean, [player]!"
    s "太过分了，[player]！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:28
translate chinese ch0_main_b13a945b:

    # mc "Well, if people stare at you for acting weird then I don't want them to think we're a couple or something."
    mc "要是你举止太怪引人围观，我可不想让他们误以为我们在交往什么的。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:30
translate chinese ch0_main_5d016585:

    # s 1a "Fine, fine."
    s 1a "好啦好啦。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:31
translate chinese ch0_main_636f00f3:

    # s "But you did wait for me, after all."
    s "不过，你还是等了我呀。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:32
translate chinese ch0_main_2640e984:

    # s "I guess you don't have it in you to be mean even if you want to~"
    s "看来你就算想凶人也凶不起来呢~"

# script-ch0.rpyc:33
translate chinese ch0_main_ff65683d:

    # mc "Whatever you say, Sayori..."
    mc "随你怎么说吧，纱世里……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:34
translate chinese ch0_main_4fe8273d:

    # s 1q "Ehehe~"
    s 1q "诶嘿嘿~"

# script-ch0.rpyc:37
translate chinese ch0_main_f870d325:

    # "We cross the street together and make our way to school."
    "我们一起穿过马路，朝学校走去。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:38
translate chinese ch0_main_6fc63fca:

    # "As we draw near, the streets become increasingly speckled with other students making their daily commute."
    "越靠近学校，路上往来的学生身影就越密集。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:40
translate chinese ch0_main_3142c5a4:

    # s "By the way, [player]..."
    s "对了，[player]……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:41
translate chinese ch0_main_02182e1b:

    # s "Have you decided on a club to join yet?"
    s "你决定好要加入什么社团了吗？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:42
translate chinese ch0_main_0855e33f:

    # mc "A club?"
    mc "社团？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:43
translate chinese ch0_main_514f6cec:

    # mc "I told you already, I'm really not interested in joining any clubs."
    mc "都说过了，我真的没兴趣参加什么社团。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:44
translate chinese ch0_main_57434f02:

    # mc "I haven't been looking, either."
    mc "也没打算去找。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:46
translate chinese ch0_main_510bdda9:

    # s 4h "Eh? That's not true!"
    s 4h "诶？才不是呢！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:47
translate chinese ch0_main_dc11d283:

    # s "You told me you would join a club this year!"
    s "你亲口说过今年会参加社团的！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:48
translate chinese ch0_main_92f7a5c6:

    # mc "Did I...?"
    mc "我说过吗……？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:49
translate chinese ch0_main_2317207b:

    # "I'm sure it's possible that I did, in one of our many conversations where I dismissively go along with whatever she's going on about."
    "说过也不是没有可能——在她喋喋不休而我随口敷衍的无数次对话里，总有那么一次吧。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:50
translate chinese ch0_main_988d7054:

    # "Sayori likes to worry a little too much about me, when I'm perfectly content just getting by on the average while spending my free time on games and anime."
    "纱世里总喜欢为我操太多心，可我自己挺知足的——成绩平平过得去，空闲时间打打游戏看看动画。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:51
translate chinese ch0_main_06a80352:

    # s 4j "Uh-huh!"
    s 4j "就是啊！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:52
translate chinese ch0_main_b2ade169:

    # s "I was talking about how I'm worried that you won't learn how to socialize or have any skills before college."
    s "我刚才还在担心，你要是在上大学之前学不会与人相处、又没有一技之长，那可怎么办。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:53
translate chinese ch0_main_61fb4fdb:

    # s "Your happiness is really important to me, you know!"
    s "你的幸福对我来说真的很重要哦！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:54
translate chinese ch0_main_12a3f20b:

    # s "And I know you're happy now, but I'd die at the thought of you becoming a NEET in a few years because you're not used to the real world!"
    s "虽然我知道你现在过得挺开心，可一想到你几年后因为不适应现实社会变成家里蹲，我就要受不了啦！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:55
translate chinese ch0_main_0df692b5:

    # s 4g "You trust me, right?"
    s 4g "你相信我的，对吧？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:56
translate chinese ch0_main_9985ba2f:

    # s "Don't make me keep worrying about you..."
    s "别让我一直为你担心嘛……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:57
translate chinese ch0_main_62185db9:

    # mc "Alright, alright..."
    mc "好好好……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:58
translate chinese ch0_main_a240cafd:

    # mc "I'll look at a few clubs if it makes you happy."
    mc "要是能让你安心，我就去看几个社团。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:59
translate chinese ch0_main_a6395f5e:

    # mc "No promises, though."
    mc "但不保证会加入。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:60
translate chinese ch0_main_4320f887:

    # s 1h "Will you at least promise me you'll try a little?"
    s 1h "那你至少答应我，会稍微努力试试？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:61
translate chinese ch0_main_185b43a6:

    # mc "Yeah, I guess I'll promise you that."
    mc "行吧，这个我答应你。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:63
translate chinese ch0_main_3c2076a4:

    # s 4r "Yaay~!"
    s 4r "耶~！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:64
translate chinese ch0_main_0ec84410:

    # "Why do I let myself get lectured by such a carefree girl?"
    "为什么我会被这么个没心没肺的女孩说教？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:65
translate chinese ch0_main_427c8d3d:

    # "More than that, I'm surprised I even let myself relent to her."
    "更让我意外的是，我居然就这样被她说动了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:66
translate chinese ch0_main_86001771:

    # "I guess seeing her worry so much about me makes me want to ease her mind at least a little bit - even if she does exaggerate everything inside of her head."
    "大概是她太为我操心的样子，让我多少想让她安心一点吧——哪怕她脑子里总把事情夸大十倍。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:71
translate chinese ch0_main_d234f771:

    # "The school day is as ordinary as ever, and it's over before I know it."
    "学校里的一天一如既往地平淡，回过神来已经放学了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:72
translate chinese ch0_main_7a46ab7f:

    # "After I pack up my things, I stare blankly at the wall, looking for an ounce of motivation."
    "收拾好书包后，我呆呆地望着墙壁，试图找回一丝干劲。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:73
translate chinese ch0_main_64e92eab:

    # mc "Clubs..."
    mc "社团啊……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:74
translate chinese ch0_main_71ad5d38:

    # "Sayori wants me to check out some clubs."
    "纱世里想让我去看几个社团。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:75
translate chinese ch0_main_aded22ad:

    # "I guess I have no choice but to start with the anime club..."
    "看来只能先从动画社开始看了……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:77
translate chinese ch0_main_fb713b14:

    # s "Hellooo?"
    s "喂——？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:79
translate chinese ch0_main_e47a0e88:

    # mc "Sayori...?"
    mc "纱世里……？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:80
translate chinese ch0_main_6020da7f:

    # "Sayori must have come into the classroom while I was spacing out."
    "八成是我发呆的工夫，纱世里进了教室。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:81
translate chinese ch0_main_1990352b:

    # "I look around and realize that I'm the only one left in the classroom."
    "环顾四周，我才发现教室里只剩我一个人了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:82
translate chinese ch0_main_dedd63de:

    # s 1a "I thought I'd catch you coming out of the classroom, but I saw you just sitting here and spacing out, so I came in."
    s 1a "本来想在门口堵你的，结果看到你一个人坐在这儿发呆，就自己进来了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:83
translate chinese ch0_main_7615d8d6:

    # s "Honestly, you're even worse than me sometimes... I'm impressed!"
    s "说真的，你有时候比我还迷糊……我都佩服了！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:84
translate chinese ch0_main_6d733c80:

    # mc "You don't need to wait up for me if it's going to make you late to your own club."
    mc "要是等我会导致你自己社团迟到，就不用特意等我了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:85
translate chinese ch0_main_9d8de398:

    # s 1y "Well, I thought you might need some encouragement, so I thought, you know..."
    s 1y "那个……我想你可能需要一点鼓励，所以就……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:86
translate chinese ch0_main_200708b1:

    # mc "Know what?"
    mc "就什么？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:87
translate chinese ch0_main_e745591c:

    # s 1a "Well, that you could come to my club!"
    s 1a "就是，你可以来我的社团呀！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:88
translate chinese ch0_main_e87e0575:

    # mc "Sayori..."
    mc "纱世里……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:89
translate chinese ch0_main_863b15e1:

    # s 4r "Yeah??"
    s 4r "怎么样？？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:90
translate chinese ch0_main_3b777b8d:

    # mc "...There is no way I'm going to your club."
    mc "……我绝对不去你们的社团。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:92
translate chinese ch0_main_f92ba1b1:

    # s 5d "Eeeehhhhh?! Meanie!"
    s 5d "诶————？！小气鬼！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:93
translate chinese ch0_main_24c0c28c:

    # "Sayori is vice president of the Literature Club."
    "纱世里是文学部的副部长。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:94
translate chinese ch0_main_3b431c20:

    # "Not that I was ever aware that she had any interest in literature."
    "我可从来不知道她对文学有什么兴趣。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:95
translate chinese ch0_main_a89001e9:

    # "In fact, I'm 99%% sure she only did it because she thought it would be fun to help start a new club."
    "说实话，我有99%%的把握——她只是觉得参与创办一个新社团会很有趣。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:96
translate chinese ch0_main_bf60a48d:

    # "Since she was the first one to show interest after the one who proposed the club, she inherited the title \"Vice President\"."
    "因为她是继社团发起人之后第一个表示加入的人，便顺理成章地继承了\"副部长\"的头衔。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:97
translate chinese ch0_main_dad2209a:

    # "That said, my interest in literature is guaranteed to be even less."
    "话虽如此，我对文学的兴趣只会比她更低。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:98
translate chinese ch0_main_67a570cc:

    # mc "Yeah. I'm going to the anime club."
    mc "嗯。我打算去动画社。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:100
translate chinese ch0_main_e9fc337c:

    # s 1g "C'mon, please?"
    s 1g "拜托啦，好不好？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:101
translate chinese ch0_main_a2239a0d:

    # mc "Why do you care so much, anyway?"
    mc "话说回来，你为什么这么在意这件事？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:102
translate chinese ch0_main_d39dce85:

    # s 5b "Well..."
    s 5b "那个……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:103
translate chinese ch0_main_d72b517e:

    # s "I kind of told the club yesterday I would bring in a new member..."
    s "我昨天好像跟部里的人说了，会带一个新成员过来……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:104
translate chinese ch0_main_dc74dc48:

    # s "And Natsuki made cupcakes and everything..."
    s "而且夏树还专门做了纸杯蛋糕什么的……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:105
translate chinese ch0_main_cc3db8cd:

    # s "Ehehe..."
    s "诶嘿嘿……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:106
translate chinese ch0_main_e05adf1b:

    # mc "Don't make promises you can't keep!"
    mc "别许下做不到的承诺啊！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:107
translate chinese ch0_main_cc62f8f9:

    # "I can't tell if Sayori is really that much of an airhead, or if she's so cunning as to have planned all of this out."
    "我分不清纱世里到底是真有那么天然，还是心机深到把这一切都算计好了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:108
translate chinese ch0_main_d02635ba:

    # "I let out a long sigh."
    "我长叹了一口气。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:109
translate chinese ch0_main_09810a2c:

    # mc "Fine... I'll stop by for a cupcake, okay?"
    mc "行吧……我就过去吃个纸杯蛋糕，行了吧？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:111
translate chinese ch0_main_56df6485:

    # s 4r "Yes! Let's go~!"
    s 4r "太好了！走吧~！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:118
translate chinese ch0_main_d005514b:

    # "And thus, today marks the day I sold my soul for a cupcake."
    "就这样，今天成了我为一个纸杯蛋糕出卖灵魂的日子。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:119
translate chinese ch0_main_cb634d94:

    # "I dejectedly follow Sayori across the school and upstairs - a section of the school I rarely visit, being generally used for third-year classes and activities."
    "我垂头丧气地跟着纱世里穿过校园、走上教学楼高层——这一带主要供三年级上课和开展活动，我很少来。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:120
translate chinese ch0_main_01a899d9:

    # "Sayori, full of energy, swings open the classroom door."
    "纱世里元气满满地一把推开了教室的门。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:126
translate chinese ch0_main_fcd53725:

    # s "Everyone! The new member is here~!"
    s "各位！新成员来啦~！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:127
translate chinese ch0_main_a17485df:

    # mc "I told you, don't call me a 'new member--'"
    mc "都说了，别叫我「新成员」——"

# script-ch0.rpyc:130
translate chinese ch0_main_6c94972f:

    # "Eh? I glance around the room."
    "诶？我环视了一圈活动室。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:132
translate chinese ch0_main_0a3aa08f:

    # y "Welcome to the Literature Club. It's a pleasure meeting you."
    y "欢迎来到文学部。很高兴见到你。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:133
translate chinese ch0_main_3c9be08b:

    # y "Sayori always says nice things about you."
    y "纱世里经常提起你，说的都是夸赞的话。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:136
translate chinese ch0_main_cc7dab55:

    # n "Seriously? You brought a boy?"
    n "不是吧？你带了个男的来？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:137
translate chinese ch0_main_2bfb1f2f:

    # n "Way to kill the atmosphere."
    n "气氛全没了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:141
translate chinese ch0_main_bf1dc1a1:

    # m "Ah, [player]! What a nice surprise!"
    m "啊，[player]！真是个惊喜！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:142
translate chinese ch0_main_d4348f02:

    # m "Welcome to the club!"
    m "欢迎来到文学部！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:144
translate chinese ch0_main_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:145
translate chinese ch0_main_00244a6d:

    # "All words escape me in this situation."
    "此情此景，我说不出话来。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:146
translate chinese ch0_main_7903e6e7:

    # "This club..."
    "这个社团……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:147
translate chinese ch0_main_4c13a14b:

    # "{i}...is full of incredibly cute girls!!{/i}"
    "{i}……全是超可爱的女孩子！！{/i}"

# script-ch0.rpyc:155
translate chinese ch0_main_b2022684:

    # n 2c "What are you looking at?"
    n 2c "看什么看？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:156
translate chinese ch0_main_89e5120b:

    # n "If you want to say something, say it."
    n "有话就说。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:157
translate chinese ch0_main_6cbd4647:

    # mc "S-Sorry..."
    mc "抱、抱歉……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:160
translate chinese ch0_main_98d9573e:

    # y "Natsuki..."
    y "夏树……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:164
translate chinese ch0_main_bc64dbb8:

    # n 5s "Hmph."
    n 5s "哼。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:167
translate chinese ch0_main_3b270b09:

    # "The girl with the sour attitude, whose name is apparently Natsuki, is one I don't recognize."
    "这个态度冲人的女孩似乎叫夏树，我并不认识她。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:168
translate chinese ch0_main_5e0f976f:

    # "Her small figure makes me think she's probably a first-year."
    "看她个子小小的，大概是一年级吧。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:169
translate chinese ch0_main_6627708c:

    # "She is also the one who made cupcakes, according to Sayori."
    "据纱世里说，纸杯蛋糕也是她做的。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:172
translate chinese ch0_main_50a3834f:

    # s "You can just ignore her when she gets moody~"
    s "她闹脾气的时候不用理她就行~"

# script-ch0.rpyc:173
translate chinese ch0_main_f4b3e5d1:

    # "Sayori says that quietly into my ear, then turns back toward the other girls."
    "纱世里在我耳边小声说完，又转向其他女孩。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:174
translate chinese ch0_main_f72302c8:

    # s 1x "Anyway! This is Natsuki, always full of energy."
    s 1x "总而言之！这位是夏树，永远活力满满。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:175
translate chinese ch0_main_77201e52:

    # s "And this is Yuri, the smartest in the club!"
    s "这位是优里，部里最聪明的！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:179
translate chinese ch0_main_084001f0:

    # y 4b "D-Don't say things like that..."
    y 4b "别、别这么说……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:180
translate chinese ch0_main_4ccfaeda:

    # "Yuri, who appears comparably more mature and timid, seems to have a hard time keeping up with people like Sayori and Natsuki."
    "优里看起来相对成熟内向，似乎很难跟上纱世里和夏树那样的节奏。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:182
translate chinese ch0_main_13900021:

    # mc "Ah... Well, it's nice to meet both of you."
    mc "啊……总之，很高兴认识你们两位。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:188
translate chinese ch0_main_34c0c312:

    # s 1a "And it sounds like you already know Monika, is that right?"
    s 1a "至于莫妮卡，你们本来就认识，对吧？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:192
translate chinese ch0_main_857b34c3:

    # m "That's right."
    m "没错。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:193
translate chinese ch0_main_3573b794:

    # m "It's great to see you again, [player]."
    m "很高兴再见到你，[player]。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:195
translate chinese ch0_main_3049c3ae:

    # "Monika smiles sweetly."
    "莫妮卡露出了甜美的微笑。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:196
translate chinese ch0_main_7c7cb783:

    # "We do know each other - well, we rarely talked, but we were in the same class last year."
    "我们确实认识——虽说几乎没说过话，但去年曾在同一个班。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:197
translate chinese ch0_main_f583350f:

    # "Monika was probably the most popular girl in class - smart, beautiful, athletic."
    "莫妮卡大概是班里最受欢迎的女生——头脑好、长得漂亮，运动也不在话下。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:198
translate chinese ch0_main_e3e8565d:

    # "Basically, completely out of my league."
    "总之，完全不是我高攀得起的类型。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:199
translate chinese ch0_main_f83977c1:

    # "So, having her smile at me so genuinely feels a little..."
    "所以，被她这样真诚地微笑注视，总觉得有点……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:200
translate chinese ch0_main_dffc1ef1:

    # mc "Y-You too, Monika."
    mc "我、我也是，莫妮卡。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:204
translate chinese ch0_main_5ade5cd5:

    # s 4x "Come sit down, [player]! We made room for you at the table, so you can sit next to me or Monika."
    s 4x "快来坐，[player]！我们在桌上给你留了位子，可以坐我旁边，也可以坐莫妮卡旁边。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:205
translate chinese ch0_main_8b8dbdb6:

    # s "I'll get the cupcakes~"
    s "我去拿纸杯蛋糕~"

# script-ch0.rpyc:208
translate chinese ch0_main_7dba2d0b:

    # n "Hey! I made them, I'll get them!"
    n "喂！是我做的，我去拿！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:211
translate chinese ch0_main_0d2a5328:

    # s 5a "Sorry, I got a little too excited~"
    s 5a "抱歉，我有点太兴奋了~"

# script-ch0.rpyc:214
translate chinese ch0_main_4c9bc219:

    # y "Then, how about I make some tea as well?"
    y "那么，由我来泡些茶，如何？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:219
translate chinese ch0_main_9f8ec8cb:

    # "The girls have a few desks arranged to form a table."
    "女孩们把几张课桌拼成了一张大桌。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:220
translate chinese ch0_main_8c49885c:

    # "As Sayori mentioned, it's been widened so that there is one space next to Monika and one space next to Sayori."
    "正如纱世里所说，桌子加宽过了，莫妮卡旁边和纱世里旁边各空出了一个位子。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:221
translate chinese ch0_main_dd182ef4:

    # "Natsuki and Yuri walk over to the corner of the room, where Natsuki grabs a wrapped tray and Yuri opens the closet."
    "夏树和优里走向活动室角落，夏树端起一个盖着锡纸的托盘，优里打开了柜子。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:222
translate chinese ch0_main_7b148be6:

    # "Still feeling awkward, I take a seat next to Sayori."
    "我带着几分拘谨，在纱世里身旁坐下。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:223
translate chinese ch0_main_f4e1d6dd:

    # "Natsuki proudly marches back to the table, tray in hand."
    "夏树得意洋洋地端着托盘走回桌边。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:225
translate chinese ch0_main_5be7519f:

    # n "Okaaay, are you ready?"
    n "好——了，准备好了吗？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:226
translate chinese ch0_main_a49f0dc7:

    # n "...Ta-daa!"
    n "……锵锵！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:229
translate chinese ch0_main_496daacd:

    # s "Uwooooah!"
    s "哇噢噢噢！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:230
translate chinese ch0_main_f7578acc:

    # "Natsuki lifts the foil off the tray to reveal a dozen white, fluffy cupcakes decorated to look like little cats."
    "夏树掀开托盘上的锡纸，露出十几个白白软软的纸杯蛋糕，一个个被装饰成了小猫的模样。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:231
translate chinese ch0_main_96ece77f:

    # "The whiskers are drawn with icing, and little pieces of chocolate were used to make ears."
    "胡须是用糖霜画的，耳朵则是用小块巧克力做的。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:233
translate chinese ch0_main_697c694e:

    # s 4r "So cuuuute~!"
    s 4r "好可爱~！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:236
translate chinese ch0_main_c9f569c5:

    # m 2b "I had no idea you were so good at baking, Natsuki!"
    m 2b "真没想到你这么会做点心，夏树！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:239
translate chinese ch0_main_ab028ca4:

    # n 2d "Ehehe. Well, you know."
    n 2d "嘿嘿，还行啦。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:240
translate chinese ch0_main_1b5731e3:

    # n "Just hurry and take one!"
    n "快点拿一个吃啦！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:241
translate chinese ch0_main_4f3b5c41:

    # "Sayori grabs one first, then Monika. I follow."
    "纱世里先拿了一个，然后是莫妮卡，我也跟着拿了一个。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:244
translate chinese ch0_main_5fdd7380:

    # s 4q "It's delicious!"
    s 4q "好好吃！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:245
translate chinese ch0_main_2e786edb:

    # "Sayori talks with her mouth full and has already managed to get icing on her face."
    "纱世里嘴里塞得满满的，脸上已经沾上了糖霜。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:246
translate chinese ch0_main_9137625a:

    # "I turn the cupcake around in my fingers, looking for the best angle to take a bite."
    "我用手指转着纸杯蛋糕，寻找最佳的下口角度。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:252
translate chinese ch0_main_2230ff25:

    # "Natsuki is quiet."
    "夏树没有说话。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:253
translate chinese ch0_main_55d0254f:

    # "I can't help but notice her sneaking glances in my direction."
    "我不由得注意到，她正偷偷往我这边瞟。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:254
translate chinese ch0_main_c0782073:

    # "Is she waiting for me to take a bite?"
    "她是在等我咬一口吗？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:255
translate chinese ch0_main_894dc484:

    # "I finally bite down."
    "我终于咬了下去。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:256
translate chinese ch0_main_31cb8e28:

    # "The icing is sweet and full of flavor - I wonder if she made it herself."
    "糖霜香甜浓郁——不知道是不是她自己调的。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:257
translate chinese ch0_main_e31bb4c4:

    # mc "This is really good."
    mc "真的很好吃。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:258
translate chinese ch0_main_4c34725b:

    # mc "Thank you, Natsuki."
    mc "谢谢你，夏树。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:259
translate chinese ch0_main_feae3ba6:

    # n 5h "W-Why are you thanking me? It's not like I...!"
    n 5h "为、为什么要谢我？我又没有……！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:260
translate chinese ch0_main_8aa3724b:

    # "{i}(Haven't I heard this somewhere before...?){/i}"
    "{i}（这台词我怎么好像在哪听过……？）{/i}"

# script-ch0.rpyc:262
translate chinese ch0_main_0b0590da:

    # n 5s "...Made them for you or anything."
    n 5s "……又没有特意做给你吃。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:263
translate chinese ch0_main_cbdb9568:

    # mc "Eh? I thought you technically did. Sayori said--"
    mc "诶？可严格来说不就是吗？纱世里说——"

# script-ch0.rpyc:265
translate chinese ch0_main_3c076ae6:

    # n 12c "Well, maybe!"
    n 12c "好、好算是吧！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:266
translate chinese ch0_main_3963d9b0:

    # n "But not for, y-you know, {i}you!{/i} Dummy..."
    n "但不是为了、你懂的，{i}特意给你！{/i}笨蛋……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:267
translate chinese ch0_main_62185db9_1:

    # mc "Alright, alright..."
    mc "行行行……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:270
translate chinese ch0_main_e11ca288:

    # "I give up on Natsuki's weird logic and dismiss the conversation."
    "我放弃理解夏树的奇怪逻辑，不再纠缠这个话题。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:271
translate chinese ch0_main_28adc331:

    # "Yuri returns to the table, carrying a tea set."
    "优里端着一套茶具回到桌边。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:272
translate chinese ch0_main_3b0ad38e:

    # "She carefully places a teacup in front of each of us before setting down the teapot next to the cupcake tray."
    "她在每个人面前小心翼翼地摆好茶杯，再把茶壶放在纸杯蛋糕托盘旁。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:274
translate chinese ch0_main_b0102204:

    # mc "You keep a whole tea set in this classroom?"
    mc "你们在活动室里备了一整套茶具？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:275
translate chinese ch0_main_63fe0000:

    # y "Don't worry, the teachers gave us permission."
    y "请放心，这是征得老师们同意的。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:276
translate chinese ch0_main_efc4ed34:

    # y "After all, doesn't a hot cup of tea help you enjoy a good book?"
    y "毕竟，一杯热茶不是更能让人享受阅读的乐趣吗？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:277
translate chinese ch0_main_a3a3b943:

    # mc "Ah... I-I guess..."
    mc "啊……也、也是……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:279
translate chinese ch0_main_de8b3252:

    # m "Ehehe, don't let yourself get intimidated, Yuri's just trying to impress you."
    m "呵呵，别被吓到啦，优里只是想给你留下好印象而已。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:281
translate chinese ch0_main_d1e9e5c9:

    # y 3n "Eh?! T-That's not..."
    y 3n "诶？！才、才不是……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:282
translate chinese ch0_main_6f8e7fc9:

    # "Insulted, Yuri looks away."
    "优里像是受了冒犯，移开了视线。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:283
translate chinese ch0_main_0403ff06:

    # y 4b "I meant that, you know..."
    y 4b "我的本意是……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:284
translate chinese ch0_main_03220b59:

    # mc "I believe you."
    mc "我相信你。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:285
translate chinese ch0_main_e29518b6:

    # mc "Well, tea and reading might not be a pastime for me, but I at least enjoy tea."
    mc "虽然品茶读书算不上我的爱好，但至少茶我还是喜欢的。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:286
translate chinese ch0_main_fb4dad3b:

    # y 2u "I'm glad..."
    y 2u "那就好……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:287
translate chinese ch0_main_c171e465:

    # "Yuri faintly smiles to herself in relief."
    "优里像是松了口气，独自浅浅一笑。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:288
translate chinese ch0_main_ef1106ab:

    # "Monika raises an eyebrow, then smiles at me."
    "莫妮卡挑了挑眉，随即对我一笑。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:292
translate chinese ch0_main_6825feaf:

    # m 1 "So, what made you consider the Literature Club?"
    m 1 "话说，是什么让你考虑来文学部的呢？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:293
translate chinese ch0_main_6b0ed824:

    # mc "Um..."
    mc "唔……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:294
translate chinese ch0_main_dc25391e:

    # "I was afraid of this question."
    "我就怕她问这个。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:295
translate chinese ch0_main_e8c5b463:

    # "Something tells me I shouldn't tell Monika that I was practically dragged here by Sayori."
    "直觉告诉我，不该告诉莫妮卡自己是被纱世里硬拽来的。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:296
translate chinese ch0_main_7fc001c4:

    # mc "Well, I haven't joined any clubs yet, and Sayori seemed really happy here, so..."
    mc "这个……我还没加入任何社团，而纱世里在这里似乎很开心，所以……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:297
translate chinese ch0_main_fd3149d6:

    # m 1j "That's okay! Don't be embarrassed!"
    m 1j "没关系！别不好意思嘛！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:298
translate chinese ch0_main_ce2d7c11:

    # m 1b "We'll make sure you feel right at home, okay?"
    m 1b "我们会让你有宾至如归的感觉，好吗？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:299
translate chinese ch0_main_c706e39a:

    # m "As president of the Literature Club, it's my duty to make the club fun and exciting for everyone!"
    m "作为文学部的部长，让部里的每个人都能玩得开心尽兴，就是我的职责！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:301
translate chinese ch0_main_a32c6d1d:

    # mc "Monika, I'm surprised."
    mc "莫妮卡，我倒有点好奇。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:302
translate chinese ch0_main_eee6c6cb:

    # mc "How come you decided to start your own club?"
    mc "你为什么会想自己创办社团呢？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:303
translate chinese ch0_main_4c32cc5d:

    # mc "You could probably be a board member for any of the major clubs."
    mc "随便哪个大型社团，你应该都能当上干部吧。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:304
translate chinese ch0_main_e482a1a0:

    # mc "Weren't you a leader of the debate club last year?"
    mc "你去年不是辩论社的骨干吗？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:305
translate chinese ch0_main_ac39b15e:

    # m 5 "Ahaha, well, you know..."
    m 5 "哈哈，这个嘛……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:306
translate chinese ch0_main_762f40f1:

    # m "To be honest, I can't stand all of the politics around the major clubs."
    m "老实说，我受不了大型社团里那些明争暗斗。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:307
translate chinese ch0_main_0ee5c447:

    # m "It feels like nothing but arguing about the budget and publicity and how to prepare for events..."
    m "整天就为了预算、宣传、活动筹备吵个没完……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:308
translate chinese ch0_main_874ed9a4:

    # m "I'd much rather take something I personally enjoy and make something special out of it."
    m "我更想拿自己真正喜欢的东西，把它做成特别的存在。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:309
translate chinese ch0_main_5744d684:

    # m 1b "And if it encourages others to get into literature, then I'm fulfilling that dream!"
    m 1b "如果还能带动更多人爱上文学，那我的梦想也就实现了！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:312
translate chinese ch0_main_e707a53f:

    # s "Monika really is a great leader!"
    s "莫妮卡真是个好部长！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:314
translate chinese ch0_main_da545528:

    # "Yuri also nods in agreement."
    "优里也赞同地点了点头。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:319
translate chinese ch0_main_d8791778:

    # mc "Then I'm surprised there aren't more people in the club yet."
    mc "那部里到现在还没什么人，就有点奇怪了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:320
translate chinese ch0_main_d49bb743:

    # mc "It must be hard to start a new club."
    mc "创办新社团想必不容易吧。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:321
translate chinese ch0_main_be7ec00e:

    # m 3b "You could put it that way."
    m 3b "可以这么说。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:322
translate chinese ch0_main_75b36957:

    # m "Not many people are very interested in putting out all the effort to start something brand new..."
    m "没多少人愿意费尽心力，去开创一个全新的东西……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:323
translate chinese ch0_main_e8c57f75:

    # m "Especially when it's something that doesn't grab your attention, like literature."
    m "更何况是文学这种乍看之下吸引不了眼球的东西。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:324
translate chinese ch0_main_1ca5227d:

    # m "You have to work hard to convince people that you're both fun and worthwhile."
    m "你必须努力让别人相信，这个社团既有乐趣又有价值。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:325
translate chinese ch0_main_2d2540fa:

    # m "But it makes school events, like the festival, that much more important."
    m "但也正因如此，学园祭这样的校园活动才显得格外重要。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:326
translate chinese ch0_main_5d278e4b:

    # m 2k "I'm confident that we can all really grow this club before we graduate!"
    m 2k "我有信心，在毕业之前，我们一定能让文学部发展壮大！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:327
translate chinese ch0_main_f8598f30:

    # m "Right, everyone?"
    m "对吧，各位？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:330
translate chinese ch0_main_a03b41d0:

    # s "Yeah!"
    s "嗯！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:334
translate chinese ch0_main_d4e34ad8:

    # y "We'll do our best."
    y "我们会尽力的。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:339
translate chinese ch0_main_91310346:

    # n "You know it!"
    n "那当然！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:340
translate chinese ch0_main_b250c385:

    # "Everyone enthusiastically agrees."
    "大家都干劲十足地应和着。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:341
translate chinese ch0_main_fffaaae6:

    # "Such different girls, all interested in the same goal..."
    "性格迥异的女孩们，却怀着同一个目标……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:342
translate chinese ch0_main_e4ea91ed:

    # "Monika must have worked really hard just to find these three."
    "莫妮卡为了聚集起这三个人，一定付出了很多努力。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:343
translate chinese ch0_main_568069f4:

    # "Maybe that's why they were all so delighted by the idea of a new member joining."
    "或许正因如此，新成员的到来才会让她们如此欣喜。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:344
translate chinese ch0_main_08aa7ac3:

    # "Though I still don't really know if I can keep up with their level of enthusiasm about literature..."
    "只是我仍不清楚，自己能否跟上她们对文学的那份热情……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:352
translate chinese ch0_main_63db5da7:

    # y "So, [player], what kinds of things do you like to read?"
    y "对了，[player]，你平时喜欢读些什么书呢？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:353
translate chinese ch0_main_cf79ccdb:

    # mc "Well... Ah..."
    mc "这个……啊……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:354
translate chinese ch0_main_5fcc5273:

    # "Considering how little I've read these past few years, I don't really have a good way of answering that."
    "考虑到这几年几乎没读过什么书，我实在不知该怎么回答。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:355
translate chinese ch0_main_1947382b:

    # mc "...Manga..."
    mc "……漫画……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:356
translate chinese ch0_main_459c1918:

    # "I mutter quietly to myself, half-joking."
    "我半开玩笑地小声嘀咕。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:358
translate chinese ch0_main_c6e48974:

    # "Natsuki's head suddenly perks up."
    "夏树的头猛地抬了起来。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:359
translate chinese ch0_main_9101cacb:

    # "It looks like she wants to say something, but she keeps quiet."
    "她似乎想说什么，但还是忍住了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:362
translate chinese ch0_main_8c105e2a:

    # y 3u "N-Not much of a reader, I guess..."
    y 3u "看、看来平时不怎么读书呢……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:363
translate chinese ch0_main_68d50b2d:

    # mc "...Well, that can change..."
    mc "……嘛，这也是可以改变的……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:364
translate chinese ch0_main_ccf38a3c:

    # "What am I saying?"
    "我在说什么啊？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:365
translate chinese ch0_main_3b4ce5c9:

    # "I spoke without thinking after seeing Yuri's sad smile."
    "看到优里落寞的神情，我竟不假思索地说出了口。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:366
translate chinese ch0_main_ca4f61b8:

    # mc "Anyway, what about you, Yuri?"
    mc "总之，你呢，优里？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:367
translate chinese ch0_main_a89289a8:

    # y 1l "Well, let's see..."
    y 1l "这个，我想想……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:368
translate chinese ch0_main_de0357e1:

    # "Yuri traces the rim of her teacup with her finger."
    "优里的手指沿着杯沿轻轻划动。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:369
translate chinese ch0_main_17dec8ac:

    # y 1a "My favorites are usually novels that build deep and complex fantasy worlds."
    y 1a "我最喜欢的，通常是那些构建出深邃复杂幻想世界的小说。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:370
translate chinese ch0_main_24dcace1:

    # y "The level of creativity and craftsmanship behind them is amazing to me."
    y "其中蕴含的创造力与写作功力，总令我叹为观止。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:371
translate chinese ch0_main_ff3c844f:

    # y 1f "And telling a good story in such a foreign world is equally impressive."
    y 1f "而在那样一个陌生的世界里讲好一个故事，同样了不起。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:372
translate chinese ch0_main_c77e0dd8:

    # "Yuri goes on, clearly passionate about her reading."
    "优里继续说着，显然对读书满怀热忱。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:373
translate chinese ch0_main_30d11e87:

    # "She seemed so reserved and timid since the moment I walked in, but it's obvious by the way her eyes light up that she finds her comfort in the world of books, not people."
    "从我进门起她就显得拘谨怕生，可此刻她眼中放出的光芒明白地告诉我：她的归宿在书的世界，而非人的世界。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:374
translate chinese ch0_main_830d7316:

    # y 2m "But you know, I like a lot of things."
    y 2m "不过，我喜欢的东西其实很多。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:375
translate chinese ch0_main_7aa57972:

    # y "Stories with deep psychological elements usually immerse me as well."
    y "带有深刻心理描写的作品，也常常令我沉醉其中。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:376
translate chinese ch0_main_b1a75737:

    # y 2a "Isn't it amazing how a writer can so deliberately take advantage of your own lack of imagination to completely throw you for a loop?"
    y 2a "作者能如此处心积虑地利用你想象力的空白，把你耍得团团转——这难道不奇妙吗？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:377
translate chinese ch0_main_98f09acd:

    # y "Anyway, I've been reading a lot of horror lately..."
    y "总之，我最近读了不少恐怖小说……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:378
translate chinese ch0_main_b274f53a:

    # mc "Ah, I read a horror book once..."
    mc "啊，我也读过一本恐怖的……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:379
translate chinese ch0_main_e7c359a6:

    # "I desperately grasp something I can relate to at the minimal level."
    "我拼命抓住一个勉强能扯上关系的例子。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:380
translate chinese ch0_main_6b8ceb25:

    # "At this rate, Yuri might as well be having a conversation with a rock."
    "再这么下去，优里简直是在跟一块石头对话了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:382
translate chinese ch0_main_dac3be05:

    # m "Really? I wouldn't have expected that, Yuri."
    m "是吗？真没想到呢，优里。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:383
translate chinese ch0_main_cb2111ac:

    # m "For someone as gentle as you..."
    m "像你这么温柔的人……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:386
translate chinese ch0_main_84a13e28:

    # y 1a "I guess you could say that."
    y 1a "也许吧。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:387
translate chinese ch0_main_38b0ae71:

    # y "But if a story makes me think, or takes me to another world, then I really can't put it down."
    y "但只要一个故事能让我思考，或是带我去往另一个世界，我就怎么也放不下了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:388
translate chinese ch0_main_fa55ff2a:

    # y "Surreal horror is often very successful at changing the way you look at the world, if only for a brief moment."
    y "超现实恐怖作品往往很擅长改变你看待世界的方式——哪怕只是短短一瞬。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:391
translate chinese ch0_main_b8c3c144:

    # n "Ugh, I hate horror..."
    n "呃，我最讨厌恐怖了……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:394
translate chinese ch0_main_1c139e48:

    # y 1f "Oh? Why's that?"
    y 1f "哦？为什么呢？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:397
translate chinese ch0_main_ab1562c5:

    # n 5c "Well, I just..."
    n 5c "就、就是……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:398
translate chinese ch0_main_7aac067b:

    # "Natsuki's eyes dart over to me for a split second."
    "夏树的视线在一瞬间扫向了我。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:399
translate chinese ch0_main_98c7c1c1:

    # n 5q "Never mind."
    n 5q "没什么。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:402
translate chinese ch0_main_5d936510:

    # m 1a "That's right, you usually like to write about cute things, don't you, Natsuki?"
    m 1a "对了，夏树写的东西通常都很可爱，对吧？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:405
translate chinese ch0_main_f053d184:

    # n "W-What?"
    n "什、什么？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:406
translate chinese ch0_main_3df32e44:

    # n "What gives you that idea?"
    n "你为什么这么想？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:409
translate chinese ch0_main_550dd777:

    # m 3b "You left a piece of scrap paper behind last club meeting."
    m 3b "上次部活的时候，你落了一张草稿纸。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:410
translate chinese ch0_main_e37f3c62:

    # m "It looked like you were working on a poem called--"
    m "上面好像是一首诗，标题是——"

# script-ch0.rpyc:413
translate chinese ch0_main_1e455dfe:

    # n "Don't say it out loud!!"
    n "不许念出来！！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:414
translate chinese ch0_main_ff703620:

    # n "And give that back!"
    n "还有，把它还给我！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:417
translate chinese ch0_main_7ae96939:

    # m 1j "Fine, fine~"
    m 1j "好好~"

# script-ch0.rpyc:424
translate chinese ch0_main_fa944ba0:

    # s "Ehehe, your cupcakes, your poems..."
    s "诶嘿嘿，你的纸杯蛋糕，你的诗……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:425
translate chinese ch0_main_da28403a:

    # s "Everything you do is just as cute as you are~"
    s "你做的每件事都跟你本人一样可爱~"

# script-ch0.rpyc:427
translate chinese ch0_main_c429c3fc:

    # "Sayori sidles up behind Natsuki and puts her hands on her shoulders."
    "纱世里悄悄凑到夏树身后，把手搭上她的肩膀。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:429
translate chinese ch0_main_6ccf1bfd:

    # n 1v "{i}I'm not cute!!{/i}"
    n 1v "{i}我才不可爱！！{/i}"

# script-ch0.rpyc:433
translate chinese ch0_main_af8472c2:

    # mc "Natsuki, you write your own poems?"
    mc "夏树，你自己写诗吗？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:434
translate chinese ch0_main_30d37f9a:

    # n 1c "Eh? Well, I guess sometimes."
    n 1c "诶？偶尔写写吧。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:435
translate chinese ch0_main_842dce39:

    # n "Why do you care?"
    n "你问这个干嘛？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:436
translate chinese ch0_main_fe27eb16:

    # mc "I think that's impressive."
    mc "我觉得挺厉害的。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:437
translate chinese ch0_main_ccafd1bb:

    # mc "Why don't you share them sometime?"
    mc "要不要找机会给大家看看？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:438
translate chinese ch0_main_3f199bd2:

    # n 5q "N-No!"
    n 5q "不、不行！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:439
translate chinese ch0_main_edb6ed7f:

    # "Natsuki averts her eyes."
    "夏树移开了视线。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:440
translate chinese ch0_main_9d7b9bad:

    # n "You wouldn't...like them..."
    n "你们不会……喜欢的……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:441
translate chinese ch0_main_35a5aeea:

    # mc "Ah...not a very confident writer yet?"
    mc "啊……对自己写的东西还没什么自信？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:443
translate chinese ch0_main_7e67e889:

    # y "I understand how Natsuki feels."
    y "我明白夏树的感受。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:444
translate chinese ch0_main_a387c89f:

    # y "Sharing that level of writing takes more than just confidence."
    y "要把那样私密的作品示人，需要的可不只是自信。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:445
translate chinese ch0_main_e06ca773:

    # y 2k "The truest form of writing is writing to oneself."
    y 2k "最真实的文字，是写给自己的文字。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:446
translate chinese ch0_main_d2b7c428:

    # y "You must be willing to open up to your readers, exposing your vulnerabilities and showing even the deepest reaches of your heart."
    y "你必须甘愿向读者敞开自己，暴露自己的软肋，甚至展示内心最深处的角落。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:450
translate chinese ch0_main_d526bbf0:

    # m "Do you have writing experience too, Yuri?"
    m "优里也有写作经验吗？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:451
translate chinese ch0_main_2bc6a16e:

    # m "Maybe if you share some of your work, you can set an example and help Natsuki feel comfortable enough to share hers."
    m "要不你也分享一些自己的作品，带个头，让夏树也能安心拿出她的诗。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:453
translate chinese ch0_main_5a6499dc:

    # y 3o "..."
    y 3o "……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:454
translate chinese ch0_main_19552c38:

    # mc "I guess it's the same for Yuri..."
    mc "看来优里也一样……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:456
translate chinese ch0_main_ec936eb4:

    # s "Aww... I wanted to read everyone's poems..."
    s "啊……人家好想读大家的诗……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:463
translate chinese ch0_main_701e440d:

    # "We all sit in silence for a moment."
    "一时间，大家都沉默了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:465
translate chinese ch0_main_e74385d7:

    # m "Okay!"
    m "好！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:466
translate chinese ch0_main_2ffc1dd9:

    # m "I have an idea, everyone~"
    m "我有个主意，各位~"

# script-ch0.rpyc:469
translate chinese ch0_main_95cd0d51:

    # ny "...?"
    ny "……？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:470
translate chinese ch0_main_d080e0ca:

    # "Natsuki and Yuri look quizzically at Monika."
    "夏树和优里一脸疑惑地看向莫妮卡。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:471
translate chinese ch0_main_a4f63044:

    # m 2b "Let's all go home and write a poem of our own!"
    m 2b "我们各自回家，写一首自己的诗吧！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:472
translate chinese ch0_main_cd1a6280:

    # m "Then, next time we meet, we'll all share them with each other."
    m "等下次见面，大家互相分享。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:473
translate chinese ch0_main_a106107a:

    # m "That way, everyone is even!"
    m "这样谁都不会不好意思了！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:476
translate chinese ch0_main_963b3971:

    # n 5q "U-Um..."
    n 5q "那、那个……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:479
translate chinese ch0_main_71a86863:

    # y "..."
    y "……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:484
translate chinese ch0_main_6766811d:

    # s "Yeaaah! Let's do it!"
    s "好耶！就这么办！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:486
translate chinese ch0_main_cdd2d381:

    # m 1a "Plus, now that we have a new member, I think it will help us all get a little more comfortable with each other, and strengthen the bond of the club."
    m 1a "而且正好有新成员加入，这样也能让大家更亲近些，让部里更团结。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:487
translate chinese ch0_main_26116031:

    # m "Isn't that right, [player]?"
    m "你说对吧，[player]？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:489
translate chinese ch0_main_871cb3a3:

    # "Monika smiles warmly at me once again."
    "莫妮卡再次对我露出温暖的笑容。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:490
translate chinese ch0_main_cf25d371:

    # mc "Hold on...there's still one problem."
    mc "等等……还有个问题。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:492
translate chinese ch0_main_bee826cb:

    # m 1d "Eh? What's that?"
    m 1d "诶？什么问题？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:493
translate chinese ch0_main_376d0c21:

    # "Now that we're back to the original topic of me joining the club, I bluntly come forth with what's been on my mind the entire time."
    "话题绕回入部这件事，我索性把憋了一路的话直说了出来。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:495
translate chinese ch0_main_5ce8ccfa:

    # mc "I never said I would join this club!"
    mc "我可从没说过要加入这个社团！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:496
translate chinese ch0_main_b0a068b5:

    # mc "Sayori may have convinced me to stop by, but I never made any decision."
    mc "纱世里只是说服我过来看看，我还没做任何决定。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:497
translate chinese ch0_main_4de02539:

    # mc "I still have other clubs to look at, and...um..."
    mc "我还要看看别的社团，而且……唔……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:502
translate chinese ch0_main_1e4b58a1:

    # "I lose my train of thought."
    "我的话头断了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:503
translate chinese ch0_main_3b7e2967:

    # "All four girls stare back at me with dejected eyes."
    "四个女孩全都用失落的眼神望着我。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:505
translate chinese ch0_main_8911e105:

    # m 1p "B-But..."
    m 1p "可、可是……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:507
translate chinese ch0_main_a403322e:

    # y 2v "I'm sorry, I thought..."
    y 2v "对不起，我以为……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:509
translate chinese ch0_main_bc64dbb8_1:

    # n 5s "Hmph."
    n 5s "哼。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:511
translate chinese ch0_main_48b8805c:

    # s 1k "[player]..."
    s 1k "[player]……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:512
translate chinese ch0_main_a99ed1fe:

    # mc "Y-You all..."
    mc "你们、你们啊……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:513
translate chinese ch0_main_966cc463:

    # "I...I'm defenseless against these girls."
    "我……我对这些女孩子毫无招架之力。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:514
translate chinese ch0_main_d4da3079:

    # "How am I supposed to make a clear-headed decision when it's like this?"
    "这叫人怎么冷静地做决定啊？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:515
translate chinese ch0_main_1f374c38:

    # "That is, if writing poems is the price I need to pay in order to spend every day with these beautiful girls..."
    "不过，如果写诗就是和这些可爱女孩们共度每一天的代价……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:516
translate chinese ch0_main_36037676:

    # mc "...Right."
    mc "……好吧。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:517
translate chinese ch0_main_ee38c6e2:

    # mc "Okay, I've decided, then."
    mc "好，我决定了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:518
translate chinese ch0_main_bfead9f9:

    # mc "I'll join the Literature Club."
    mc "我加入文学部。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:523
translate chinese ch0_main_4423eaff:

    # "One by one, the girls' eyes light up."
    "女孩们的眼睛一个个亮了起来。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:525
translate chinese ch0_main_7265c99b:

    # s 4r "Yesss! I'm so happyyy~"
    s 4r "太棒了！人家好开心~"

# script-ch0.rpyc:526
translate chinese ch0_main_4037de6b:

    # "Sayori wraps her arms around me, jumping up and down."
    "纱世里抱住我，兴奋得蹦蹦跳跳。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:527
translate chinese ch0_main_4fb65cd5:

    # mc "H-Hey--"
    mc "喂、喂——"

# script-ch0.rpyc:529
translate chinese ch0_main_792dfef8:

    # y 1m "You really did scare me for a moment..."
    y 1m "刚才真的吓了我一跳……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:532
translate chinese ch0_main_e9faf06e:

    # n 5q "If you really just came for the cupcakes, I would be super pissed."
    n 5q "你要是真只为了纸杯蛋糕才来的，我会超级火大。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:535
translate chinese ch0_main_e1457fb7:

    # m 5 "Then that makes it official!"
    m 5 "那就正式定了！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:536
translate chinese ch0_main_4fb57992:

    # m "Welcome to the Literature Club!"
    m "欢迎加入文学部！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:538
translate chinese ch0_main_fc5c3668:

    # mc "Ah...thanks, I guess."
    mc "啊……总之，谢了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:546
translate chinese ch0_main_e719ebca:

    # m 3b "Okay, everyone!"
    m 3b "好了，各位！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:547
translate chinese ch0_main_94ecc185:

    # m "I think with that, we can officially end today's meeting on a good note."
    m "我想，今天的活动就可以圆满结束啦。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:548
translate chinese ch0_main_435b8f44:

    # m "Everyone remember tonight's assignment:"
    m "大家别忘了今晚的作业："

# script-ch0.rpyc:549
translate chinese ch0_main_f3222edc:

    # m "Write a poem to bring to the next meeting, so we can all share!"
    m "写一首诗带来，下次一起分享！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:550
translate chinese ch0_main_f7602550:

    # "Monika looks over at me once more."
    "莫妮卡又看了我一眼。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:551
translate chinese ch0_main_7c3950aa:

    # m 1a "[player], I look forward to seeing how you express yourself."
    m 1a "[player]，我很期待看到你会如何表达自己。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:553
translate chinese ch0_main_45d9cd96:

    # m "Ehehe~"
    m "呵呵~"

# script-ch0.rpyc:554
translate chinese ch0_main_5aa72ccd:

    # mc "Y-Yeah..."
    mc "嗯、嗯……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:557
translate chinese ch0_main_c5a873f7:

    # "Can I really impress the class star Monika with my mediocre writing skills?"
    "就我这半吊子的文笔，真能让年级红人莫妮卡刮目相看吗？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:558
translate chinese ch0_main_6944e055:

    # "I already feel the anxiety welling up inside me."
    "不安已经开始在我心里翻涌。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:559
translate chinese ch0_main_a90aebad:

    # "Meanwhile, the girls continue to chit-chat as Yuri and Natsuki clean up their food."
    "另一边，优里和夏树收拾着茶点，女孩们继续闲聊。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:561
translate chinese ch0_main_9957133c:

    # s "Hey, [player], since we're already here, do you want to walk home together?"
    s "对了，[player]，反正都到这儿了，一起回家吧？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:562
translate chinese ch0_main_62fc13da:

    # "That's right - Sayori and I never walk home together anymore because she always stayed after school for clubs."
    "是啊——以前因为纱世里总要留下来参加社团活动，我们已经很久没一起回家了。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:563
translate chinese ch0_main_336bf349:

    # mc "Sure, might as well."
    mc "行啊，正好。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:564
translate chinese ch0_main_df253bf7:

    # s 4q "Yaay~"
    s 4q "耶~"

# script-ch0.rpyc:569
translate chinese ch0_main_55e5370a:

    # "With that, the two of us depart the clubroom and make our way home."
    "就这样，我们两人离开活动室，踏上回家的路。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:570
translate chinese ch0_main_7df62755:

    # "The whole way, my mind wanders back and forth between the four girls:"
    "一路上，我的思绪在四个女孩之间来回游走："

# script-ch0.rpyc:572
translate chinese ch0_main_f67abbfb:

    # "Sayori,"
    "纱世里，"

# script-ch0.rpyc:574
translate chinese ch0_main_fa99dc55:

    # "Natsuki,"
    "夏树，"

# script-ch0.rpyc:576
translate chinese ch0_main_f8ee4cf6:

    # "Yuri,"
    "优里，"

# script-ch0.rpyc:578
translate chinese ch0_main_b3c6e50b:

    # "and, of course, Monika."
    "还有，当然，莫妮卡。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:579
translate chinese ch0_main_3ec099e1:

    # "Will I really be happy spending every day after school in a literature club?"
    "每天放学后都泡在文学部里，我真的会幸福吗？"

# script-ch0.rpyc:580
translate chinese ch0_main_2b5dfb83:

    # "Perhaps I'll have the chance to grow closer to one of these girls..."
    "说不定，我还有机会和其中某个人走得更近……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:586
translate chinese ch0_main_16cd82b1:

    # "Alright!"
    "好了！"

# script-ch0.rpyc:587
translate chinese ch0_main_b0188844:

    # "I'll just need to make the most of my circumstances, and I'm sure good fortune will find me."
    "只要充分利用眼前的处境，好运一定会找上门来。"

# script-ch0.rpyc:588
translate chinese ch0_main_dff2799d:

    # "And I guess that starts with writing a poem tonight..."
    "而这一切，就从今晚写一首诗开始吧……"

# script-ch0.rpyc:595
translate chinese ch0_kill_e1554201:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

